IR Sensors Board Schematic (textual): ir_sensors.kicad_sch

Components:
- TSOP1..TSOP5: TSOP38238 receivers x5 with outputs S1..S5
- J1: IR_CONN (6-pin) - 3.3V, GND, S1, S2, S3, S4, S5 (if 7-pin use S5)
- POGO_PAD: three pad footprints for docking contact
- Optional ADC stage: if analog photodiodes are used, include op-amp amplifiers and low-pass filters

Notes:
- TSOP outputs are active low pulses; pull-ups recommended on main board if needed
- Place a small shield or shade over sensors to limit ambient stray light

Netlist:
- NET 3V3: TSOPx VCC -> main board 3V3
- NET GND: common
- NET S1..S5: digital outputs to main board GPIOs
